    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ars Vox Arcana</strong> is a voice-driven fantasy <strong>duel-game</strong> where you command magic through spoken incantations. <br>Whether in full VR or with PC and mouse and keyboard, you take the role of a wizard whose words shape reality. This is more than spellcasting. This is language-born sorcery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/ed8e93e312e9d3f4326f6a27b35250be.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in magical duels with your friends, where strategy and spellcasting skill determine the victor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/afe5ec21a5cca5de39a20460fbf3c646.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Say the words, shape the world. Build incantations in real time using modular arcane phrases. Each word changes the result\u2014no menus, just magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/ed6682e699456848b317055e9a3b6868.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span>Ars Vox Arcana is built for VR immersion, but fully supports traditional PC play.<br>Both modes offer the same depth, spellcraft, and progression.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/148f74413d432bfa8046ea41b6d44aa3.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine hidden forms, elements, and whispers of power. Discover new interactions, refine your ritual voice, and experiment with arcane structures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/0c17900feb9eda4ef194439e980f40f6.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything is processed locally for seamless and private spellcasting. No cloud, no delays\u2014your voice acts instantly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/9933994a3d82dbbc2bf37fb890c3045b.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock deeper layers of language. Find fragments of forgotten speech, each a piece of a greater magical truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ars Vox Arcana</strong> is a voice-driven fantasy <strong>duel-game</strong> where you command magic through spoken incantations. <br>Whether in full VR or with PC and mouse and keyboard, you take the role of a wizard whose words shape reality. This is more than spellcasting. This is language-born sorcery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/ed8e93e312e9d3f4326f6a27b35250be.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in magical duels with your friends, where strategy and spellcasting skill determine the victor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/afe5ec21a5cca5de39a20460fbf3c646.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Say the words, shape the world. Build incantations in real time using modular arcane phrases. Each word changes the result\u2014no menus, just magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/ed6682e699456848b317055e9a3b6868.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span>Ars Vox Arcana is built for VR immersion, but fully supports traditional PC play.<br>Both modes offer the same depth, spellcraft, and progression.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/148f74413d432bfa8046ea41b6d44aa3.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine hidden forms, elements, and whispers of power. Discover new interactions, refine your ritual voice, and experiment with arcane structures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/0c17900feb9eda4ef194439e980f40f6.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything is processed locally for seamless and private spellcasting. No cloud, no delays\u2014your voice acts instantly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/9933994a3d82dbbc2bf37fb890c3045b.avif?t=1746830772\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock deeper layers of language. Find fragments of forgotten speech, each a piece of a greater magical truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Cast spells with your voice in a fantasy world shaped by language and will. Originally designed for VR, but fully playable on PC without a headset. Your voice is your power\u2014no matter how you play.",
